	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Navigate Datadog from Alfred. Read-only: every action opens a URL, copies text or refreshes a local cache.

- ddd — dashboards and notebooks (nb: / db: to restrict; ⌘ with the time range, ⌥ copy URL, ⇧ search the dashboard list)
- dds — APM services (↩ service page, ⌘ logs, ⌥ traces, ⌃ error tracking, ⇧ monitors, ⇧⌘ copy name)

Queries: free terms match names; env:&lt;env&gt; overrides DD_ENV; a last token such as -15m, -4h or -7d sets the time range (default -1h, live).

Requires pup (brew install datadog-labs/pack/pup) logged in with `pup auth login`. Configure DD_SITE and DD_ENV in the workflow configuration.
</string>
